  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The number of molecule(s) or ion(s) from the following having non-planar structure is______.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>NO</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>BF</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>PCl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>XeF</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>SF</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>XeO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>PH</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>Al</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo></msup></math></p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "6",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The species which have&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;hybridisation with no lone pairs,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;hybridisation with two lone pairs are planar molecules.</p><p>The number of hybrid orbitals can be calculated as follows,</p><p>No.of hybrid orbitals = 1/2(V+M-C+A)</p><p>V = number of valence electrons</p><p>M = number of monovalent atoms attached to central atom.</p><p>C = Number of positive charges on the molecule</p><p>A =&nbsp;Number of negative charges on the molecule</p><p>&nbsp;</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Planar</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>BF</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Planar</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>NO</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Planar</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>SF</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Non-Planar</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Non-Planar</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>PCl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Non-Planar</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Al</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Non-Planar</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>XeF</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Planar</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>XeO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Non-Planar</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>PH</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></msubsup></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Non-Planar</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table></blockquote>"
  }
